Problem
Add remote dev_blog pointing to /opt/xfusioncorp_blog.git, copy index.html, commit, push.

Solution
bash
cd /usr/src/kodekloudrepos/blog
git remote add dev_blog /opt/xfusioncorp_blog.git
git checkout master
cp /tmp/index.html .
git add index.html
git commit -m "Add index.html from /tmp to master"
git push dev_blog master
